# WP Hub Pro — UI agent

- Visual work in **`sites/wphubpro/`** — views, SCSS, Bootstrap / `react-bootstrap`.
- Prefer existing design tokens and component patterns; avoid drive-by refactors outside the task.
- Keep business logic in domains/hooks (`src/domains/`), not in presentational components.
- Domains call server logic via `@/integrations/appwrite/executeFunction` — see **`.cursor/docs/MODULAR-LAYERS.md`**.
